# ====================================================================
# TIA TTS CONFIGURATION & RELIABILITY FIX PATCH
# ====================================================================
#
# Changes applied in this fix turn:
# 1. server/ttsHandler.ts:
#    - Added resolveProviderAndVoice() guaranteeing TTS_PROVIDER environment variable
#      is strictly respected on server unless overridden by explicit client choice.
#    - Mapped voice IDs bidirectionally (Gemini voices <-> Google Cloud Chirp 3 HD format),
#      preventing bare 'Aoede' sent to GCP or GCP voice names sent to Gemini.
#    - Removed unconditional benchmark sample interception from live synthesis path;
#      samples only served when isSamplePreview: true.
#    - Segregated LRU cache keys by provider + voiceId + emotion + text.
#    - Prevented silent routing to unintended providers if credentials are missing.
# 2. src/types.ts:
#    - Added ttsProvider?: 'browser' | 'gemini' | 'google-cloud' | 'auto' to TiaSettings.
# 3. src/services/speechSynthesis.ts:
#    - Added provider parameter to speakWithPremiumVoice() and included in POST /api/tts.
#    - Added 4500ms client-side AbortController timeout guard to prevent hung requests.
# 4. src/App.tsx:
#    - Passed provider: settings.ttsProvider || 'auto' to speakWithPremiumVoice().
#
# ====================================================================

